{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1438234-memory-bleed-discussion","id":1438234,"title":"Memory Bleed discussion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-05T20:41:47-08:00","id":1438234,"title":"Memory Bleed discussion","content":"One of the most complex conditions in the game besides benbenet. When a cultist is hit with Memory Bleed from a mummy taking them over, I noticed it mentions integrity, virtue, and vice in addition to memory, burden, and balance.<br /> <br /> You always have virtue, vice, burden, and balance with a character like this, do you have both integrity and memory or only one, based off the primary personality? And are supernatural merits &amp; immortal abilities, if applicable, immediately lost or only when it resolves? Do you have deathless resilience immediately or only when it resolves?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-07T07:59:51-08:00","id":1438464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1438234-memory-bleed-discussion#post1438234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the most complex conditions in the game besides benbenet. When a cultist is hit with Memory Bleed from a mummy taking them over, I noticed it mentions integrity, virtue, and vice in addition to memory, burden, and balance.<br /> <br /> You always have virtue, vice, burden, and balance with a character like this, do you have both integrity and memory or only one, based off the primary personality? And are supernatural merits &amp; immortal abilities, if applicable, immediately lost or only when it resolves? Do you have deathless resilience immediately or only when it resolves?</div> </div> </div> </div>The way I\u2019d work it is that it would depend on which perspective you\u2019re using. While you would have both Memory and Integrity, only the one that matters to the character would be worth worrying about, and only Memory would matter once the process is complete. I\u2019d take a similar approach to the powers, Merits, etc. It\u2019s all about perspective and the story you\u2019re trying to tell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}